     "text": "The following information relates to Coppervale Industries (CL).\n\nInformation:\n  Coppervale Industries (CL) purchased 360 units of inventory for Rs. 16,200 early in the year and a further 120 units for Rs. 1,200 later in the year. 160 units were sold during the year. The company uses the weighted-average cost method.\n\nYou are given the following relationship:\n  Weighted-average cost per unit = Total cost of goods available for sale / Total units available for sale.\n\nRequired:\nCalculate the weighted-average cost per unit and the cost of the closing inventory at the year end. Show all workings. (16 marks)\n\nNote to candidates: the relationship stated above is given. Marks are not awarded for reproducing it. You are required to show all workings and to state any assumption on which your answer depends.",
