     "text": "The following information relates to Thornbury International (TL).\n\nInformation:\n  Thornbury International (TL) agreed to pay Glenmara International (GL) a fee of Rs. 2,400 net of tax. The fee is subject to withholding at 20%, which is to be deducted from the fee, so that Glenmara International (GL) receives the stated net amount.\n\nYou are given the following relationship:\n  Where an amount is stated net of a deduction, the gross amount is found by grossing up: Gross = Net / (1 - Deduction rate). The deduction is then Gross less Net.\n\nRequired:\nCalculate the gross fee payable by Thornbury International (TL), the amount of tax to be deducted, and the net amount to be remitted to Glenmara International (GL). Show all workings. (10 marks)\n\nNote to candidates: the relationship stated above is given. Marks are not awarded for reproducing it. You are required to show all workings and to state any assumption on which your answer depends.",
