     "text": "Coppervale Productions (CL) operates a manufacturing and trading business and the cost and management information below relates to its operations.\n\nThe following facts have been established:\n(a) Coppervale Productions (CL) installed a database management system for its transaction processing on 13 January 2026. No database administrator has been appointed and the vendor holds the only set of administrator passwords.\n(b) During the nightly batch at Coppervale Productions (CL) on 13 January 2026, a failure part way through left the customer balance table updated and the invoice table not.\n\nThe requirements to be considered in answering this question are those governing Artificial Intelligence (AI), namely:\n(i) Artificial Intelligence (AI) refers to the simulation of human intelligence processes by machines, particularly computer systems.\n(ii) AI processes include learning (acquiring information and rules for using it), reasoning (using rules to reach conclusions), and self-correction.\n(iii) Data Preprocessing – Cleaning, transforming, and organizing data for modeling.\n\nRequired:\nSet out, with reasons, the treatment required for each of the matters described, and the disclosures that must accompany them. (19 marks)",
