     "type": "NUMERICAL",
     "marks": 8.0,
     "text": "The following information relates to Coppervale Consulting (CL).\n\nInformation:\n  Total sales of the market in which Coppervale Consulting (CL) operates were Rs. 435,000 million in the earlier year and Rs. 469,800 million in the most recent year. The market comprises 16 firms and Coppervale Consulting (CL) holds approximately 14% of it.\n\nYou are given the following relationship:\n  Market growth rate = [(Sales in the most recent year / Sales in the earlier year) - 1] x 100.\n\nRequired:\nCalculate the annual market growth rate and state whether Coppervale Consulting (CL) should treat the market as a high-growth or a low-growth market. Show all workings. (8 marks)\n\nNote to candidates: the relationship stated above is given. Marks are not awarded for reproducing it. You are required to show all workings and to state any assumption on which your answer depends.",
